WEBVTT

00:05.970 --> 00:06.890
This can't be true.

00:08.890 --> 00:09.900
Yorito...

00:15.500 --> 00:16.430
Are you all right?

00:16.700 --> 00:17.420
Yeah.

00:17.960 --> 00:18.680
But... why did I...

00:18.680 --> 00:19.850
But... why did I...

00:21.000 --> 00:21.940
Where's Matsuri?

00:23.080 --> 00:24.130
I don't know.

00:24.520 --> 00:25.900
This is all I could-

00:25.900 --> 00:27.000
I have to find her.

00:28.940 --> 00:29.590
Yorito!

00:32.200 --> 00:33.760
I have... something important to tell you.

00:33.760 --> 00:34.930
I have... something important to tell you.

00:51.270 --> 00:57.690
hane ga shiroku hikari mabushiku tondeyuku

00:51.270 --> 00:57.690
White feathers gleam and fly away brightly

00:58.110 --> 01:04.740
kokoro dake nosete hoshii no ni

00:58.110 --> 01:04.740
Though I only want to set my heart on them

01:05.740 --> 01:12.000
tsumetai te wo nobasu todokanai... shitteru

01:05.740 --> 01:12.000
I extend my cold hands - They won't reach... I know

01:12.630 --> 01:19.720
dakedo ima furetai kimi ni

01:12.630 --> 01:19.720
But I want to touch you now

01:19.930 --> 01:25.850
natsukashii kaze ni ha ano koro no fune

01:19.930 --> 01:25.850
On that nostalgic wind - A ship from the past

01:26.260 --> 01:34.270
maboroshi ga omoide wo miseta

01:26.260 --> 01:34.270
An illusion showed me memories

01:35.340 --> 01:44.280
"wasurenai" dareka no koe ga setsunaku hibiku

01:35.340 --> 01:44.280
"I won't forget" Someone's voice echoes painfully

01:44.450 --> 01:49.370
hajimaru yokan ni furuete

01:44.450 --> 01:49.370
Trembling with a foreboding

01:49.660 --> 01:57.710
"wasuretai" negau jibun ga wakaranai

01:49.660 --> 01:57.710
"I want to forget" I cannot understand myself for hoping so

01:58.090 --> 02:07.430
matteiru yurarenagara yume hitotsu wo

01:58.090 --> 02:07.430
I shall wait while swaying, for that one dream

02:15.030 --> 02:20.030
Flickering Illusion

02:20.490 --> 02:22.830
Foie Gras Onigiri

02:20.490 --> 02:22.830
Shark Fin Onigiri

02:20.490 --> 02:22.830
Horuhoru Bird

02:20.490 --> 02:22.830
Truffles

02:20.490 --> 02:22.830
Caviar

02:20.490 --> 02:22.830
Dried Fish

02:20.490 --> 02:22.830
Durian

02:20.490 --> 02:22.830
Chou Melon

02:20.490 --> 02:22.830
Tomato Bean Juice

02:20.910 --> 02:21.870
Let's see...

02:23.160 --> 02:24.450
I guess this one... and that one...

02:24.450 --> 02:25.910
I guess this one... and that one...

02:30.670 --> 02:31.540
They don't have it!

02:32.290 --> 02:35.460
Excuse me, do you have any tomato bean juice?

02:36.800 --> 02:37.590
No way!

02:38.130 --> 02:39.050
We're sorry, sir.

02:39.050 --> 02:42.260
But we no longer carry tomato bean juice.

02:42.260 --> 02:43.800
I see...

02:45.100 --> 02:47.180
Bearded dandy.

02:47.180 --> 02:48.600
A-And you're...

02:48.600 --> 02:50.060
Sae.

02:50.060 --> 02:51.400
Sakura Sae.

02:51.400 --> 02:54.070
I just recently showed you that photo.

02:54.440 --> 02:55.610
Ah, that was you?

02:56.400 --> 02:58.610
So you work in a convenience store, too.

02:59.990 --> 03:02.700
Excuse me, were you looking for something?

03:03.160 --> 03:03.870
Yeah, that's right.

03:12.420 --> 03:13.210
I see.

03:14.040 --> 03:15.960
So that girl named Aono is...

03:16.800 --> 03:18.760
Yup, that's how it is.

03:19.050 --> 03:22.680
So, as I said, I created this mess.

03:22.680 --> 03:23.430
Wait.

03:23.720 --> 03:25.260
Then what is Yorito?

03:25.510 --> 03:26.350
It's fine.

03:26.510 --> 03:27.680
Don't worry about it.

03:27.680 --> 03:28.270
But-

03:28.270 --> 03:29.730
Tattered-rabbit punch!

03:31.640 --> 03:34.110
You don't have to worry about that.

03:34.400 --> 03:36.650
Anyway, where's the food?

03:36.860 --> 03:39.740
I want to taste that foie gras onigiri!

03:39.990 --> 03:42.490
Why do you always try to change the topic like that?

03:44.410 --> 03:46.620
I know Takeshi gave you a hard time,

03:46.620 --> 03:48.790
and because of that, you don't trust us yet.

03:49.080 --> 03:50.160
You're wrong.

03:50.330 --> 03:53.500
It's not like I don't trust you guys.

03:54.790 --> 03:58.920
It's just that I've gotten used to this kind of lifestyle through the years.

04:00.460 --> 04:02.630
Because if I didn't,

04:08.680 --> 04:10.220
it'd be too hard on me.

04:20.030 --> 04:21.820
No way! That must be a lie!

04:22.240 --> 04:23.320
I'm not lying to you.

04:23.530 --> 04:25.110
Please, you must believe me!

04:31.160 --> 04:32.790
...tomato bean juice?

04:32.790 --> 04:34.960
Yeah, tomato bean juice.

04:34.960 --> 04:37.330
The bearded dandy came to buy that.

04:37.330 --> 04:38.290
Really?

04:39.170 --> 04:40.130
Tomato...

04:48.890 --> 04:49.890
All right.

04:50.430 --> 04:53.730
Today, school ended in the morning,

04:53.730 --> 04:56.900
and I thought eating alone would be lonely.

04:57.230 --> 04:57.940
I see.

04:58.150 --> 04:59.440
Am I bothering you?

04:59.980 --> 05:00.900
Not really.

05:01.190 --> 05:02.610
More importantly, the frying pan...

05:04.320 --> 05:06.660
Um, wh-what should I do?

05:06.910 --> 05:09.620
In this situation, I should...

05:12.080 --> 05:13.660
I'm very sorry.

05:13.660 --> 05:14.410
Give it to me.

05:18.540 --> 05:19.750
U-Um, you have to set it to low.

05:19.750 --> 05:22.710
U-Um, you have to set it to low.

05:24.840 --> 05:26.010
Why did you come here?

05:27.720 --> 05:31.010
Didn't Mana tell you not to come here?

05:32.430 --> 05:34.480
But if I did that, you'd be all alone.

05:34.480 --> 05:37.020
But if I did that, you'd be all alone.

05:43.530 --> 05:44.780
Yorito-san!

05:47.030 --> 05:48.410
Yorito...

05:49.160 --> 05:50.530
I'm home, Sis.

05:50.530 --> 05:51.700
I'm home, Sis.

05:53.700 --> 05:55.330
Thank you for waiting.

05:55.330 --> 05:58.000
This is called Koyori's Special French Toast.

05:58.330 --> 06:01.210
Although half of it should be called Aono's Special.

06:01.210 --> 06:02.090
Thanks.

06:02.340 --> 06:03.920
I was starving!

06:04.170 --> 06:05.260
Thanks for the meal.

06:05.260 --> 06:06.220
Thank you for the meal.

06:08.050 --> 06:09.680
H-How is it?

06:09.890 --> 06:10.800
It's yummy.

06:11.100 --> 06:12.430
Really?

06:13.010 --> 06:14.220
And you, Aono-san?

06:14.640 --> 06:15.520
It's fine.

06:16.230 --> 06:17.730
I'm so relieved!

06:17.730 --> 06:23.270
A meal tastes great when Aono-san and Yorito-san eat it together like this.

06:23.270 --> 06:24.280
You're right.

06:24.280 --> 06:25.360
Yes!

06:25.820 --> 06:27.900
Do you always cook at home, Koyori?

06:28.700 --> 06:30.360
Well...

06:34.200 --> 06:37.830
Okay then, Ishizuki, come solve this problem.

06:39.330 --> 06:40.460
Ishizuki?

06:40.670 --> 06:42.000
Um, she said she didn't feel well, so...

06:42.000 --> 06:45.340
Um, she said she didn't feel well, so...

06:49.590 --> 06:51.260
He's so nice.

06:51.260 --> 06:55.310
He said he came to buy tomato bean juice for a friend.

06:55.310 --> 06:57.140
And where did he go?

06:58.060 --> 07:02.400
He said he would look around a little more.

07:06.940 --> 07:09.240
Well then, I'll take my leave.

07:09.780 --> 07:13.620
I'll come back tomorrow morning.

07:13.820 --> 07:14.700
Okay.

07:14.990 --> 07:18.580
Please enjoy your time together this evening.

07:33.510 --> 07:35.180
You should finish eating, Sis.

07:35.180 --> 07:36.060
I'll wash the dishes.

07:39.480 --> 07:40.480
Thank you.

07:41.980 --> 07:44.150
I hate this.

07:45.230 --> 07:46.570
What's with you all of a sudden?

07:48.570 --> 07:50.240
Why did you come back?

07:51.740 --> 07:53.360
This is our house, isn't it?

07:53.910 --> 07:54.740
It's natural that I'd come-

07:55.320 --> 07:56.490
Don't hide anything from me.

07:59.290 --> 08:02.870
Then don't hide anything from me, either, Sis.

08:03.790 --> 08:06.880
I'm not hiding anything.

08:06.880 --> 08:07.710
Yes, you are!

08:10.340 --> 08:11.760
Did you... meet with Matsuri?

08:11.760 --> 08:13.220
Did you... meet with Matsuri?

08:13.510 --> 08:14.180
No...

08:14.970 --> 08:16.510
But I remembered... what happened that day.

08:16.510 --> 08:17.640
But I remembered... what happened that day.

08:18.470 --> 08:19.720
How I stabbed Matsuri,

08:20.310 --> 08:22.520
and how you made me believe it was a dream.

08:22.810 --> 08:24.310
I remember it.

08:25.560 --> 08:26.360
Sis,

08:26.900 --> 08:28.520
you knew Matsuri before, didn't you?

08:29.730 --> 08:31.780
You're hiding something from me.

08:32.190 --> 08:32.990
Or am I wrong?

08:33.240 --> 08:34.780
I'm not hiding anything.

08:35.820 --> 08:39.450
All I wanted was to live with you in peace, Yorito.

08:53.670 --> 08:56.300
I don't need anything else.

08:56.590 --> 08:58.390
I don't need to think of anything else, either.

08:58.930 --> 08:59.640
Sis...

09:00.010 --> 09:01.310
What's wrong with that?

09:01.720 --> 09:04.390
Why are you getting angry with me?

09:04.980 --> 09:07.600
She's the one who appeared out of nowhere.

09:08.060 --> 09:10.020
Shihou Matsuri doesn't exist.

09:10.320 --> 09:11.360
That's how it is.

09:11.820 --> 09:14.110
So you do know Matsuri.

09:14.110 --> 09:15.240
It has nothing to do with you!

09:15.530 --> 09:17.490
You don't have to know anything.

09:17.700 --> 09:20.830
You're my brother, that's all.

09:21.160 --> 09:25.000
I'll make you happy with everything I have...

09:25.210 --> 09:27.080
No matter how low I have to go...

09:27.460 --> 09:28.460
That's why-

09:27.670 --> 09:28.460
That's not it.

09:31.250 --> 09:32.170
Yorito...

09:32.670 --> 09:36.050
What I want to know is the truth.

09:36.180 --> 09:36.970
Yorito-!

09:50.150 --> 09:51.440
Aono-san's... a Yaka.

09:51.440 --> 09:52.480
Aono-san's... a Yaka.

10:05.330 --> 10:06.750
Wait!

10:12.290 --> 10:13.300
I can't... any more...

10:13.300 --> 10:14.000
I can't... any more...

10:20.590 --> 10:22.640
My efforts... finally... paid off.

10:22.640 --> 10:24.640
My efforts... finally... paid off.

10:24.640 --> 10:25.600
My efforts... finally... paid off.

10:26.430 --> 10:27.430
Hey! You over there!

10:27.430 --> 10:28.770
Hey! You over there!

10:31.020 --> 10:33.070
Why... is he... so dense?!

10:33.070 --> 10:34.480
Why... is he... so dense?!

10:34.480 --> 10:35.690
Why... is he... so dense?!

10:38.490 --> 10:39.700
HEY YOU!

10:39.860 --> 10:41.570
The bearded guy with glasses!

10:41.740 --> 10:43.240
Look this way!

10:50.870 --> 10:53.420
So you came after me just because of that?

10:53.960 --> 10:54.420
Yes.

10:54.670 --> 10:57.050
Because I had to meet Matsuri-san no matter what.

10:57.380 --> 10:58.090
Matsuri?

11:01.300 --> 11:02.840
She's with you, isn't she?

11:03.720 --> 11:05.060
Where is she?

11:06.640 --> 11:10.190
Unfortunately, she isn't my friend.

11:10.820 --> 11:12.480
So don't stick your nose into this anymore.

11:15.940 --> 11:18.110
Then tell her this,

11:18.940 --> 11:21.110
"Morimiya Yorito is suffering."

11:23.030 --> 11:23.910
Okay.

11:24.530 --> 11:29.450
If I happen to see that girl wandering about town,

11:30.000 --> 11:31.500
I'll tell her without fail.

12:13.540 --> 12:16.500
I'm Koyori's sister, Ishizuki Mana.

12:16.960 --> 12:19.050
It seems like you're always taking care of her...

12:19.710 --> 12:21.380
So you're Mana-san.

12:22.880 --> 12:24.380
You go to Miike Academy?

12:24.380 --> 12:25.390
Yes.

12:25.390 --> 12:27.180
Today was the entrance ceremony.

12:28.810 --> 12:29.770
Mana-san!

12:32.270 --> 12:33.480
That's Onee-chan to you.

12:34.060 --> 12:35.190
I'm sorry.

12:36.060 --> 12:36.940
Um...

12:38.770 --> 12:40.280
He's my brother.

12:41.530 --> 12:43.280
I'm Morimiya Yorito.

12:48.950 --> 12:50.080
Nice to meet you.

12:50.080 --> 12:51.750
My name's Mana.

12:51.950 --> 12:53.160
Ishizuki Mana.

12:59.710 --> 13:00.500
Um...

13:01.590 --> 13:02.380
What is it?

13:04.760 --> 13:09.350
Ultimately, I couldn't bring myself to hide it any longer.

13:09.760 --> 13:11.810
So I'll say this honestly:

13:13.060 --> 13:15.440
I went to Aono-san's house today.

13:16.770 --> 13:17.400
I see.

13:18.190 --> 13:21.190
I'm deeply sorry for breaking my promise.

13:21.730 --> 13:25.700
But Yorito-san came back home and everything was fun as usual-

13:25.030 --> 13:25.700
Koyori.

13:26.610 --> 13:27.200
Yes?

13:28.450 --> 13:31.120
Shall we sleep together? It's been a while.

13:35.080 --> 13:35.580
Yes.

14:08.280 --> 14:09.070
Matsuri.

14:10.990 --> 14:13.080
I knew... you'd come.

14:13.080 --> 14:14.370
I knew... you'd come.

14:15.330 --> 14:15.910
Yeah.

14:17.120 --> 14:18.500
I finally remembered

14:19.250 --> 14:20.380
what happened here.

14:21.210 --> 14:21.790
I see.

14:22.380 --> 14:26.050
And then I recalled many things, although my memories are still fragmented.

14:26.760 --> 14:28.550
You were wearing a kimono,

14:29.180 --> 14:30.090
there was a cave...

14:31.430 --> 14:32.430
Hey, Matsuri.

14:33.180 --> 14:35.850
You and Sis have known each other for a long time.

14:36.430 --> 14:37.640
Probably... for several hundred years now, right?

14:37.640 --> 14:40.020
Probably... for several hundred years now, right?

14:40.900 --> 14:41.480
Yes.

14:42.310 --> 14:43.820
Then... then what am I?!

14:43.820 --> 14:44.940
Then... then what am I?!

14:45.190 --> 14:49.990
Although I'm not a Yaka, I remember you, Sis and myself from the past.

14:49.990 --> 14:50.820
I...

14:52.490 --> 14:53.370
Matsuri!

14:56.910 --> 14:59.080
Yorito did indeed exist in the past.

14:59.580 --> 15:03.000
But it's a fact that people can only live once.

15:03.710 --> 15:05.550
There's only one Yorito... and he died in the past.

15:05.550 --> 15:07.420
There's only one Yorito... and he died in the past.

15:08.550 --> 15:09.670
Then I'm...

15:11.010 --> 15:12.930
I'll show it to you now!

15:24.270 --> 15:24.770
B-Bear with it!

15:24.770 --> 15:26.070
B-Bear with it!

15:26.070 --> 15:28.780
It's the pain from knowing the truth!

15:29.150 --> 15:31.110
It's a necessary pain!

15:31.240 --> 15:32.030
Yorito!

15:34.240 --> 15:35.120
Yorito...

15:47.000 --> 15:48.800
That's your true self.

15:50.340 --> 15:52.260
That's your true form.

16:04.690 --> 16:05.610
Yorito...

16:17.450 --> 16:17.950
No!

16:18.450 --> 16:19.540
No, no!

16:22.120 --> 16:23.080
This place is...

16:35.840 --> 16:36.890
Yorito!

16:40.430 --> 16:41.600
He isn't here any more.

16:41.600 --> 16:42.680
Yorito's already-

16:42.680 --> 16:43.390
I can't...

16:43.640 --> 16:44.940
I won't accept that!

16:45.440 --> 16:46.150
Aono.

16:50.980 --> 16:52.280
It's my fault...

16:52.780 --> 16:55.820
I was the sacrifice, yet I kept living.

16:56.910 --> 16:57.450
Sis.

16:57.910 --> 16:58.620
Matsuri.

16:59.410 --> 17:02.500
And then Aono got obsessed... with the idea of recreating you.

17:02.500 --> 17:04.160
And then Aono got obsessed... with the idea of recreating you.

17:11.130 --> 17:12.460
Finally, with this...

17:24.390 --> 17:25.810
Is that what I am?

17:27.230 --> 17:29.770
Yes, an illusion that Aono created.

17:30.230 --> 17:33.360
A phantom filled with Yorito's memories.

17:33.360 --> 17:34.280
Then I'm-

18:12.730 --> 18:13.900
She hasn't come back.

18:14.940 --> 18:17.400
What? You're still awake?

18:18.280 --> 18:20.410
Lack of sleep is the skin's archenemy.

18:21.370 --> 18:23.490
Was this really for the best?

18:25.410 --> 18:27.160
You mean about that Yorito kid?

18:28.420 --> 18:30.710
He might break down after that.

18:32.090 --> 18:33.130
Maybe...

18:34.420 --> 18:35.380
Takeshi.

18:35.960 --> 18:37.340
But... it can't be helped.

18:37.340 --> 18:38.340
But... it can't be helped.

18:39.800 --> 18:42.680
He wanted to know the truth himself.

18:43.190 --> 18:44.890
Rather than live with anxiety and suffering,

18:45.180 --> 18:47.390
he chose to live within the truth.

18:47.980 --> 18:49.480
No one can stop him from doing that.

18:54.770 --> 18:56.030
We're the same, aren't we?

18:57.650 --> 18:58.190
Yeah.

18:59.900 --> 19:00.860
Want to come over?

19:01.240 --> 19:01.870
Yeah.

19:35.150 --> 19:35.860
Say.

19:37.320 --> 19:39.610
What kind of person was Yorito?

19:41.400 --> 19:44.490
Did he have the same personality as me?

19:44.950 --> 19:45.870
And like Sis-

19:46.080 --> 19:47.040
I forgot.

19:48.290 --> 19:50.000
It's in the past now.

19:50.330 --> 19:51.210
So I forgot.

19:52.080 --> 19:54.330
I only remember who you are.

19:56.460 --> 19:57.960
Just you.

20:00.260 --> 20:02.680
But I'm nothing.

20:03.260 --> 20:04.970
Neither Yorito... nor even a human.

20:04.970 --> 20:06.300
Neither Yorito... nor even a human.

20:06.970 --> 20:07.720
Just...

20:07.720 --> 20:08.350
...you.

20:09.850 --> 20:11.600
You're nobody.

20:12.350 --> 20:16.400
You're a poor phantom forced to play the role of Yorito.

20:16.940 --> 20:19.360
However, it's not like you don't exist.

20:19.360 --> 20:20.490
But I'm-

20:31.160 --> 20:32.500
You can kiss.

20:32.790 --> 20:34.040
You can hold others' hands.

20:34.460 --> 20:36.130
You do indeed exist here.

20:37.590 --> 20:40.090
Even though you're influenced by Yorito's memories,

20:40.460 --> 20:44.630
you can think for yourself and do things by yourself.

20:47.800 --> 20:50.430
I like that about you.

20:50.890 --> 20:51.720
Matsuri...

20:52.480 --> 20:53.230
So...

20:56.150 --> 20:56.940
Disappear...

20:58.690 --> 20:59.650
together with me.

21:10.410 --> 21:12.080
This is odd.

21:12.330 --> 21:13.710
She's supposed to be at home.

21:16.370 --> 21:17.710
It can't be helped. Let's go.

21:18.250 --> 21:19.170
We'll be late.

21:19.670 --> 21:20.380
But...

21:25.130 --> 21:25.880
Yorito!

21:26.840 --> 21:27.550
Hey, good morning.

21:27.550 --> 21:28.050
Hey, good morning.

21:37.940 --> 21:38.690
Are you sure?

21:39.360 --> 21:39.900
Yes.

21:40.480 --> 21:41.190
Please,

21:41.820 --> 21:43.900
teach me how to use this sword.

22:13.770 --> 22:22.440
iro aseta page no kioku hitomi tojireba yomigaeru

22:13.770 --> 22:22.440
Memories on a faded page, they revive when I close my eyes

22:22.860 --> 22:31.620
adokenai shoujo no inori
habatakeyo kibou no sora he

22:22.860 --> 22:31.620
Prayers of an innocent girl
Fly away to the sky of hope

22:31.740 --> 22:36.040
nageku mamonaku  toki wa nagareru

22:31.740 --> 22:36.040
With no time to regret, time will flow

22:36.330 --> 22:41.130
hitori tachidomaru kedo

22:36.330 --> 22:41.130
Even though I stand alone

22:42.380 --> 22:47.890
yume mamoru shirabe  kuchizu samuno

22:42.380 --> 22:47.890
A tune to protect your dreams, I sing to myself

22:48.050 --> 22:52.390
hitobito ga nemuri ni tsukeba

